, "message": "First stab at actual parsing remote ical.\n\nNeither robust, nor performing very well.", "created_at": "2010-10-15T14:56:41Z", "repo": "kalua", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "968021ac92cfb691538d73a17fc886ab55a33d68", "message": "Added basic handling of remote calendars.\n\nNo authentication, parsing or display yet.", "created_at": "2010-10-15T10:19:31Z", "repo": "kalua", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e4e3dbfb1229e5b02707621d8f576cebebfb1d95", "message": "Bumped rails version to 3.0.1", "created_at": "2010-10-15T09:13:01Z", "repo": "kalua", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9caf5e22ddf050cd6d536d347604a971744293d7", "message": "First step of cucumber integration.\n\nThis is the first time I actually use cucumber, after\nhaving read up about it several times over the years.", "created_at": "2010-10-11T17:36:45Z", "repo": "kalua", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f29c4ce2bc9ce03e5d94777de5dd3095cf79f221", "message": "And yet another bugfix.\n\nNothing beats having other people actually use your software.\nThanks to the testers.", "created_at": "2010-10-11T14:22:35Z", "repo": "kalua", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "100581689b375f0c1c6a7af79381acf490b9de4c", "message": "Another bugfix.", "created_at": "2010-10-11T13:19:43Z", "repo": "kalua", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "80d49b70584f02b71dc7381a1d0324f3f398f970", "message": "Bugfix.", "created_at": "2010-10-11T13:14:40Z", "repo": "kalua", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "cff5f08e281761507ed4b454dfc30c6ac9707b83", "message": "Allow removal of recurrence attributes.", "created_at": "2010-10-11T11:43:42Z", "repo": "kalua", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file":